{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1be78edb9d77262203d7bdb022b5f3cac2ae32981d5acff6bde4c4cc24b27bc1","ja":"紬の交通安全教室","zh":"紬的交通安全教室","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1d2d7b35c30ed6484fb6de4671d5e1b277dd277acbb8fdec8ccd63941332af35","ja":"紬の交通安全教室のリハーサルが始まって\nしばらくしたころ……","zh":"紬的交通安全讲座彩排开始后\n过了一段时间……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c68472cbe31baa2b9adf512b9ef7a9359ff687353d49231894ae3f2e5cf492d4","ja":"……このように、交差点では\nフレキシブルな対応が求められます。","zh":"……就像这样，在十字路口\n需要灵活应对。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"57a44104fcbb9cdc2f70cb923889d565a4de7e6f49f65654c94db432c2f21ffb","ja":"えっ？　えーっと……ふれきしぶる？","zh":"咦？那个……灵活变通？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"202bec517afc976cef36c3349472c1f51e244e1c739b49daf51ee90f7764fb72","ja":"特に近年、インバウンドの影響で\n交通量が増加して混雑しています。","zh":"尤其是近年来，受访日外国游客影响，\n交通量增加，十分拥挤。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"018071fdaba9905bb65bde08ae8d0e83cb67bd3f059986b38d4a9f3163a675d3","ja":"そのため、常にコンティンジェンシープランや\nリスクヘッジを考えながら行動することが大事です。","zh":"因此，时刻考虑应急预案与\n规避风险的同时采取行动是非常重要的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"9ca916593e3334621a772890ced7d4d2d55b9a056a414984d2c46530d6181f9b","ja":"インバ……？　コンなんとかヘッジ？\n誰かの名前かい？　それとも、車の種類だろうか？","zh":"因巴……？孔什么的对冲？\n是谁的名字吗？还是说是车的型号？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4e0f4852f0509d9709118cb7bc2bc199bf470d212f2f3a1778c99c871ef87678","ja":"交通の安全を守るためには、みなさんの命を\nプライオリティ最優先に置くことがマストで……。","zh":"为了守护交通安全，必须将大家的生命\n置于首要优先级……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"15494a76939262c909e0c502644da379023b1d800103fe9756fbb301981b7a0c","ja":"つ、紬さん！　ストップ、ストーップ！\n言ってることが難しすぎて、ついてけないです～！","zh":"紬、紬小姐！停下、快停下——！\n你说的话太难懂了，我跟不上啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"84e4026e7564d5d24571076efe836ba60ab7b89211f40eae65bae0b760196292","ja":"そうだねぇ。難しい用語があると、あたしたちみたいに\nわからない人が出てくるんじゃないだろか。","zh":"确实呢。要是出现难懂的专业用语，\n会不会出现像我们这样看不懂的人呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"77df3f0b0984d71bdc9ec62f376599b9947d64a2e3ffdaf3c711696630479bcb","ja":"あっ……！　そ、そうですよね。交通安全教室に\nいらっしゃる方は、老若男女、さまざまなはず……。","zh":"啊……！也、也是呢。来参加交通安全讲座的\n人，应该男女老少、各色各样的人都有才对……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"24a91944a1ff67fa5bd92c6f48bf07a4a37dde93ea0a59f8b056c1bbf7df8cbf","ja":"警察署長の講演ですから、かしこまった場に\nなるように思いこんでいました……。","zh":"既然是警察局长的演讲，\n我还以为会是更加拘谨严肃的场合呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"8e271930c80c3c9411e91b02029762627ca61e95fcb75b5a6ddad50239162502","ja":"リハーサルしていなければどうなっていたことか……。\nおふたりのおかげで、問題点が浮き彫りになりました！","zh":"要是没有彩排的话真不知道会变成什么样……。\n多亏了两位，问题才得以显现出来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"5d9bea008d97c8523509c2ff0b79c091333e1badd983c1b9be82341d0d280325","ja":"なんもなんも。それじゃあどう直すか、\n一緒に考えてみないかい？","zh":"没事没事。那要怎么改，\n要不要一起想想看？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"fed63fe8bc89850858fc72bf418b8bd58a3562c813587862b26acc211c77dd18","ja":"たとえば……車の模型とかあればいいかも！\n口で説明されるだけより、いいですよね？","zh":"比如……有汽车模型之类的话说不定会挺好的！\n比起光用嘴巴说明，这样更好吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4d164fe7ff28955cf92a96c03bb799e83929c12de928f98374d23ce05440c5cd","ja":"それなら、絵なんかもあるといいねぇ。","zh":"要是那样的话，再有些画之类的就更好了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1658.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c2bef49cd366cb33306ec4532405e41df45974e301b712a3aac89697e07e69d2","ja":"では、話し方はより柔らかく。\nボードや模型も用いて……。","zh":"那么，说话方式再温和一些。\n再结合白板和模型……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
